---
import catalog from '../../data/martin/index.mjs';

const treatments = {
  '1.1': '量子理论起源、电子与原子核、交换反对称性 | Quantum origins, electrons and nuclei, exchange antisymmetry',
  '1.2': '有效单粒子方程、Fermi–Dirac 分布、能带填充与连续性 | Effective one-particle equations, Fermi–Dirac statistics, filling, and continuity',
  '1.3': '自洽场、早期能带方法与数值表示 | Self-consistent fields, early band methods, and numerical representations',
  '1.4': '交换、关联、局域化和金属—绝缘体竞争 | Exchange, correlation, localization, and metal–insulator competition',
  '1.5': 'Hohenberg–Kohn 与 Kohn–Sham 逻辑边界 | Hohenberg–Kohn and Kohn–Sham logical boundaries',
  '1.6': '电子结构计算在研究中的证据角色 | Evidential role of electronic-structure calculations',
  '1.7': '材料设计、稳定性与可制造性门槛 | Materials design, stability, and realizability gates',
  '1.8': '拓扑不变量、能隙闭合与适用条件 | Topological invariants, gap closing, and applicability conditions',
};
---

<h2 id="source-map">原书结构与来源定位 | Source Map</h2>

<div class="chapter-source-map">
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th scope="col">节 | Section</th>
        <th scope="col">原书标题 | Martin title</th>
        <th scope="col">印刷页 | Print page</th>
        <th scope="col">本站内容 | Website treatment</th>
        <th scope="col">状态 | Status</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {catalog.parts[0].units[0].sections.map((section) => (
        <tr>
          <td><code>{section.id}</code></td>
          <td>{section.title}</td>
          <td>{section.page}</td>
          <td>{treatments[section.id]}</td>
          <td>complete</td>
        </tr>
      ))}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<p>本页采用原创表述，不转录原书正文、教材图、脚注、习题或答案。历史节点与章节组织以 Martin Chapter 1 为主要来源；补充推导明确标为本站推导。</p>
<p lang="en">This page uses original wording and does not reproduce textbook prose, figures, footnotes, exercises, or answers. Martin Chapter 1 supplies the principal structure; supplemental derivations are identified as website additions.</p>
